      "id": "vocal-health",
      "title": "Vocal Health",
      "level": 1,
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "markdown",
          "text": "**Track:** singing | **Difficulty:** 1/10 | **Time:** ~10 min"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "overview",
      "title": "Overview",
      "level": 2,
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "markdown",
          "text": "Your voice is irreplaceable equipment — protect it like a fiddler protects their hands."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "hydration",
      "title": "Hydration",
      "level": 2,
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "markdown",
          "text": "Water before and during gigs. Alcohol and caffeine dehydrate vocal folds. Steam inhalation helps before singing."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "rest",
      "title": "Rest",
      "level": 2,
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "markdown",
          "text": "Avoid shouting over noisy pubs before sets. Schedule vocal rest days after demanding gigs."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "warm-up-and-cool-down",
      "title": "Warm-up and cool-down",
      "level": 2,
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "markdown",
          "text": "Gentle hum descending after performance. Don't go from full belt to silence."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "warning-signs",
      "title": "Warning signs",
      "level": 2,
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "markdown",
          "text": "Hoarseness >2 weeks, pain, loss of range — see ENT specialist. Nodules from chronic misuse are preventable."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "environment",
      "title": "Environment",
      "level": 2,
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "markdown",
          "text": "Dry air, smoke, and allergens irritate folds. Humidifier in hotel rooms on tour."
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
