  "quiz_markdown": "### Q1. Persistent hoarseness over two weeks warrants:\n\n- A) Medical evaluation\n- B) Singing louder\n- C) Ignoring it\n- D) Only whispering forever\n\n**Answer:** A\n\n### Q2. Hydration supports healthy vocal fold function.\n\n**Answer:** True\n\n### Q3. Vocal cool-down after gig:\n\n- A) Gentle descending hums\n- B) Immediate maximum-volume singing\n- C) Complete dehydration\n- D) Shouting celebrations\n\n**Answer:** A",
